@page
@inject TimeProvider Clock
@{ViewData["Title"]="Free, Pro and Custom plans"; ViewData["Description"]="A useful Free plan for one unit, free launch Pro for five units, and Custom requirements. No checkout or automatic charges.";}
<p class="eyebrow">ONE PROPERTY. SMALL, CLEAR PLANS.</p><h1>Start with free Pro access.</h1>
<p>These plans are for StayWidget. Property owners are expected to publish their accommodation prices on their own website; the widget does not calculate guest price quotes.</p>
<p>@ProductPlans.Offer(Clock.GetUtcNow())</p>
<div class="columns plan-cards"><section class="card"><h2>Free</h2><p class="price">$0</p><p>One property, one owner, one open rentable unit.</p><p>Core requests, manual inventory, calendar and CSV export. Visible StayWidget and Funtoolio attribution.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/Owner/Plans">Choose Free</a></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Pro</h2><p class="price">Free early access</p><p>One property, one owner, five open units. Removable branding.</p><p>Proposed future standard price: <strong>@ProductPlans.ProposedProPrice</strong>. Annual offer and tax treatment are not finalized. Checkout is unavailable.</p><a class="button" href="/Owner">Start free Pro</a></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Custom</h2><p class="price">Contact for a quote</p><p>Discuss bounded requirements for one property. Larger limits require review and an explicit agreement; the current preview still stores at most five units.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/Owner/Feedback?kind=Custom">Send requirements (sign in)</a></section></div>
<section class="card"><h2>Included and bounded</h2><p>All plans include the complete request → owner decision → inventory workflow. No monthly commercial request cap. Safety controls reject new attempts visibly: five/network/ten minutes, 100/property/UTC day, plus bounded public reads. Existing requests and exact receipt retries are preserved.</p><p>A stored-unit safety limit of five includes closed/draft units. Plan quotas count open units. Choosing Free above its limit preserves existing units, bookings, management and export; reopening a closed unit is blocked until usage is reduced or free Pro chosen. Promotion expiry never deletes data or disables existing units.</p><p>Guest confirmation email is included when configured, with sending safeguards across all plans. Only an owner confirmation queues an email; pending requests do not send email. A shared daily sending budget can delay delivery without cancelling a reservation. Owners can see delivery status and contact guests directly when needed. No online payment or external calendar sync on any plan. Same retention policy across plans: closed unaccepted enquiry contacts 90 days; booking contact data 12 months after departure/cancellation; nonpersonal history up to 24 months. Future bookings are not purged for quotas. These defaults require legal review before live intake.</p><p><a href="/Limitations">Read the limitations</a> · <a href="/Contact">Self-service support</a> · <a href="/Terms">Service terms</a></p></section>
